{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在压缩人物动机时损失了部分因果细节，尤其S03没有像X那样交代怒气仍在却又因亲近记忆而短暂高兴，S07也弱化了当初只想着摆脱委屈、没料到孤单的心理来由。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确视觉抓手，短句和感受词又能随音乐进程出现，普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每一段正在发生什么。它从失去亲近、反复怀疑，到重新认识自己的需要，最后带着想念继续生活，主线清楚，音乐细节也更具体，情绪变化有层次，不只是简单贴上悲伤、快乐等标签。X的优势是人物心理的因果解释更完整，尤其能让人明白他为什么既想回去又不愿回去；这是Y为了凝练而付出的真实代价。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "077627ca-ad5f-4c52-be24-b355d8eaff6f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224838120401Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:49:30.638251+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "829b7d6fbaa59e79b3e0a378eae2ddb4272b6a5c7512a3a553407e2ddd0a5870", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"